                      (    forth6809.asm):04851         ; ------------------------------------------------------------
                      (    forth6809.asm):04852         ; TSTLOGIC - logic, shift, and address-arithmetic tests (glossary
                      (    forth6809.asm):04853         ; section 3.6). Covers every word in that section. Several of
                      (    forth6809.asm):04854         ; these (INVERT, CELLS, CELL+, CHARS, CHAR+, ALIGNED) modify the
                      (    forth6809.asm):04855         ; top of stack in place (LDD/op/STD) rather than PULU/PSHU - the
                      (    forth6809.asm):04856         ; tests verify what's observable via the stack either way, not
                      (    forth6809.asm):04857         ; how each implementation gets there. Three words (CHARS, ALIGN,
                      (    forth6809.asm):04858         ; ALIGNED) are documented no-ops on this system; CHARS/ALIGNED
                      (    forth6809.asm):04859         ; still get a normal single-value test (verifying identity),
                      (    forth6809.asm):04860         ; while ALIGN - which takes no stack arguments at all - gets a
                      (    forth6809.asm):04861         ; dedicated test pushing decoy values to confirm the whole stack,
                      (    forth6809.asm):04862         ; not just one value, is genuinely undisturbed. RSHIFT tested
                      (    forth6809.asm):04863         ; against a negative input specifically, since it's documented
                      (    forth6809.asm):04864         ; logical (zero-fill), not arithmetic (sign-preserving) - the
                      (    forth6809.asm):04865         ; case that actually distinguishes the two conventions, same
                      (    forth6809.asm):04866         ; reasoning already applied to 2/ and FM/MOD vs SM/REM earlier.
                      (    forth6809.asm):04867         ; ------------------------------------------------------------
C1E9 BDFC2B           (    forth6809.asm):04868         TSTLOGIC:  JSR   CRW
C1EC 8EC1FD           (    forth6809.asm):04869                    LDX   #TSTLOGICMSG
C1EF 3610             (    forth6809.asm):04870                    PSHU  X
C1F1 CC0005           (    forth6809.asm):04871                    LDD   #5
C1F4 3606             (    forth6809.asm):04872                    PSHU  D
