                      (    forth6809.asm):08583         ; then executes the result. Verifies it pushes its own PFA
                      (    forth6809.asm):08584         ; address (matching VARIABLE's own DOESRT0 behavior - BUFFER:
                      (    forth6809.asm):08585         ; shares it) and that VARHERE genuinely advanced by exactly the
                      (    forth6809.asm):08586         ; requested 10 bytes - not just that some space was reserved.
