                      (    forth6809.asm):13273         ; TSTREPLSUBS1 - unit test for REPLACES and SUBSTITUTE together
                      (    forth6809.asm):13274         ; (can only be meaningfully tested together - SUBSTITUTE depends
                      (    forth6809.asm):13275         ; on a prior REPLACES registration). Registers "X"->"Z", then
                      (    forth6809.asm):13276         ; runs the template "%%A%X%B%Y%" through SUBSTITUTE - covering
                      (    forth6809.asm):13277         ; three of the four documented cases in one pass: "%%" collapses
                      (    forth6809.asm):13278         ; to a single '%', "%X%" (a registered name) gets replaced
                      (    forth6809.asm):13279         ; (count incremented), and "%Y%" (not registered) passes through
                      (    forth6809.asm):13280         ; unchanged, delimiters included. Expected result ("%AZB%Y%",
                      (    forth6809.asm):13281         ; count=1) independently simulated in Python against the actual
                      (    forth6809.asm):13282         ; traced algorithm before writing this test, not hand-derived
                      (    forth6809.asm):13283         ; and hoped correct - see TSTREPLSUBS2 for the fourth case
                      (    forth6809.asm):13284         ; (unpaired trailing '%'), tested separately for clearer failure
                      (    forth6809.asm):13285         ; diagnosis.
