                      (    forth6809.asm):13971         ; TSTSIGN - unit test for SIGN. Deliberately poisons the CPU
                      (    forth6809.asm):13972         ; flags with an unrelated CMPX (setting them to reflect a
                      (    forth6809.asm):13973         ; positive comparison result, without touching D or the value
                      (    forth6809.asm):13974         ; about to be pushed) immediately before each PSHU/JSR SIGN
