FF3A 3606             (    forth6809.asm):21348                    PSHU  D
FF3C 39               (    forth6809.asm):21349                    RTS
                      (    forth6809.asm):21350         
FF3D CC0000           (    forth6809.asm):21351         FALSEBODY: LDD   #$0000
FF40 3606             (    forth6809.asm):21352                    PSHU  D
FF42 39               (    forth6809.asm):21353                    RTS
                      (    forth6809.asm):21354         
